'''Sector S-29''' was an area on the [[planet]] [[Onderon]] that was home to the [[Onderon rebels]]' [[Saw Gerrera's camp|secret base]] around [[20 BBY]]. It was also the site of a small battle in the [[Onderonian Civil War]] as well.<ref name="A War on Two Fronts" />

